{"id":"aeropuerto","lemma":"aeropuerto","pos":"noun","rank":1299,"glosses":["airport","a Peruvian dish based on fried rice with chicken eggs and various other ingredients"],"ipa":"/ˌaeɾoˈpweɾto/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"aeropuertos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4b/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodrigo5260-aeropuerto.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Dónde está el aeropuerto?","en":"Where's the airport?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453341"},{"text":"Los aviones aterrizan en los aeropuertos.","en":"Airplanes land at airports."},{"text":"El aeropuerto está cerrado.","en":"The airport is closed.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/71088"},{"text":"El aeropuerto está cerca.","en":"The airport is close by.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/611608"},{"text":"Te llevaré al aeropuerto.","en":"I'll drive you to the airport.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/355231"}]}